# One demo clip: the keys, and how long to let the screen reader talk after each.
# k = press (logged, gets a click in the final audio)    t = type text (logged, 220 ms a character)
# q = press, not logged (setup, trimmed)                  Q = type, not logged
# w = wait seconds                                        x = launch the app (-Launch)
# The clip starts at the first logged key, so do setup with q/Q before it.

# Setup, cut from the recording: switch to the view the demo starts in.
q ^+v
w 1
q {DOWN}
q {ENTER}
w 4

# The demo.
k ^+p
w 3
t gtf
w 5
k {ENTER}
w 6
k {ESC}
w 3
